---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Select validated template]
    B --> C[Review metadata and repository link]
    C --> D[Submit GitHub issue]
    D --> E[Maintainer receives submission]
    E --> F[Inspect manifest and assets]
    F --> M_val{" "}
    M_val --> G[Validate template]
    G --> H[Review generated preview]
    H --> I{Template acceptable?}

    I -- No, changes needed --> J[Request changes]
    J --> K[Publisher modifies template]
    K --> M_val

    I -- No, reject --> L[Reject submission with feedback]
    L --> M([End])

    I -- Yes --> N[Apply approved-and-verified label]
    N --> O[Publish template in marketplace]
    O --> P([End])
